<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective Nov 7-13:</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 105.05</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 101.26</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  56.78</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$  94.04</p>
</text>
